---
config:
  theme: redux-color
  look: neo
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 14px
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant App as Booking / payment
  participant Promotion as Promotion module
  participant DB as MySQL

  Guest->>App: Preview stay with optional promo code
  App->>Promotion: Find best eligible offer
  Promotion->>DB: Read offers and usage limits
  Promotion-->>App: Discounted quote
  App-->>Guest: Show total and price fingerprint
  Note over App,Promotion: Offers do not stack<br/>Preview uses no capacity

  Guest->>App: Confirm booking
  App->>Promotion: Recheck current quote
  Promotion-->>App: Validated price and selected offer
  App->>DB: Begin transaction and create booking
  App->>Promotion: Reserve selected promotion
  Promotion->>DB: Check limits under locks and save reservation
  App->>DB: Commit booking and reservation
  App-->>Guest: Booking and payment details

  alt Payment succeeds
    App->>Promotion: Redeem reservation
    Promotion->>DB: Mark redeemed and update usage
  else Unpaid booking cancelled or expired
    App->>Promotion: Release reservation
    Promotion->>DB: Mark released and restore capacity
  end
